Prettiest MMORPG i've played in my life. For real. From the character creation screen to the massively expansive world, there is just so many that pleases you. The difficulty level can be steep with some class (*couch* warriors *cough*), and though fun, other classes' hardwork and contributions can be so unappreciated (*cough* priests *cough*), but all in all, you're bound to meet some good eggs and you'll have plenty of fun together.
Word of advice: ask for a BuddyUp code before you play this, trust me. And that's about it: say hi to people, be polite and friendly, and your journey is going to be super fun.
