Let's sum up the essentials:
+ Charming somehow, taking into account the okay Retro soundtrack;
- Unresponsive controls: if on the edge of a platform, it often seems impossible to jump...
- Hitboxes are larger than they should;
- No remapping features, dealing with A + D (left, right) & J(ump);
- Bugs: got stuck a few times + after a revisit, loading brought me back to an earlier point -- thankfully this game is short;
- Fall damage, as mentioned very often!
Not too painful to complete and still a bit satisfying, but I just can't recommend an Alpha - Beta game that's considered a Stable Release.
5/10
